"[Transmutation: Perfect Recreation of the Human Form] lets a Spirit Beast fully become human."
"Bonded spirit beasts can take human form once strong enough, as several at Fa Ram have."
"Jin's [Divert the Waters] can cut foes off from ambient Qi and crack their Domains."
"[Divert the Waters] also lets a cultivator go along a lake or river bed inside a bubble of air."
"Shen Yu made the Indomitable Spirit path to be built on each disciple's own struggle."
"The Celestial Constellation Soul Art is a rare bloodline gift set by the dominant star at birth."
"Those born under the Star of Kingship gain great charisma and command: an uncrowned Prince."
"Those born under the Star of Foresight gain divination sight; crippling it can break the mind."
"[Till the Land] invokes Ancestor Shennong's teaching to soften barren earth, not destroy it."
"Casting [Till the Land] at scale needs a circular formation carved into the earth first."
"At scale, [Till the Land] purifies soil and rivers while sparing ore veins and mines."
"Soon Jin and Meiling will cast [Till the Land] at five points in the Ironfields over five days."
